sequence-diagram

typeface clean
styleMode shadow
colorMode pastel
autoNumber on

Customer [icon: user] > CommerceAPI [label: "Commerce API"]: POST /checkout + Idempotency-Key
CommerceAPI > Checkout [label: "Checkout & Orders"]: Validate request
Checkout > Database [icon: aws-rds, label: "PostgreSQL"]: Find existing idempotency result
Database --> Checkout: No prior result
Checkout > Inventory [label: "Inventory Service"]: Reserve SKU quantities
Inventory > Database: Atomic conditional stock update + reservation
Database --> Inventory: Reservation committed
Inventory --> Checkout: reservation_id
Checkout > Database: Create order=PENDING_PAYMENT
Database --> Checkout: order_id
Checkout > Payment [label: "Payment Provider"]: Create payment(order_id, idempotency key)
Payment --> Checkout: payment_authorized
Checkout > Database: Transaction: mark PAID + write outbox event
Database --> Checkout: Commit
Checkout --> CommerceAPI: Order confirmed
CommerceAPI --> Customer: 200 order_id + confirmed status
Checkout > OutboxRelay [label: "Outbox Relay"]: Read committed event
OutboxRelay > EventBus [icon: aws-eventbridge, label: "EventBridge"]: OrderPaid
EventBus > Workers [icon: aws-simple-queue-service, label: "SQS Consumers"]: Async fan-out
Workers --> Checkout: Fulfilment / notification / analytics proceed asynchronously
